    <Notes ShowOnLoad="0" Notes="TCE1:TCE-SC-20261014-H1&#10;Hardware: JPT YDFLP-E-60-M7-M-R 60 W, serial MC2BDJD71684; lens: F-Theta 174 mm; material: titanium (link the exact grade and batch in the experiment record).&#10;Secondary LightBurn Fill-mode scan check. Five 10 x 8 mm patches vary only line interval 0.01/0.025/0.05/0.10/0.20 mm. Fixed P20%, F48 kHz, V2000 mm/s, PW200 ns, one sublayer/global pass, bidirectional, no cross-hatch. This compares hatch overlap/texture and scan workload; it does not determine the laser source's power or pulse limits. Use the Line plates for those.&#10;Canvas 76 x 35 mm; registered bounds 98 x 72.5 mm. First: full-area cross-hatched cleaning, 20% / 48 kHz / 2000 mm/s / 200 ns / 0.05 mm; second: black marker/label layer 25% / 60 kHz / 150 mm/s / 200 ns / 0.01 mm, one pass."/>
